        "The main path jumps through .htext at 0x40f000 to self-deletion at 0x401390. That routine derives its module short path, obtains COMSPEC and creates a /c del command. Canceling INC/DEC and self-move/exchange runs are real executable padding.",
        "Other branches extract resource DLL 101 with the resource-to-WriteFile chain at 0x402460, create a victim process, allocate/write remote memory, resolve LoadLibraryA and call CreateRemoteThread (0x401150).",
        "The LanmanServer branch deletes then replaces ServiceDLL through RegDeleteValueA/RegSetValueExA at 0x401260.",
        "Family DLL/banner and loader-code fingerprints support StormAttack. The collector filename does not establish Remcos or WannaCry.",
        "The embedded PE starts at file offset 0x5060. Its entrypoint/import/export regions are zeroed; successful payload execution and advertised DDoS/other capabilities are not inferred."
